        "TileImage": "$($repository 22d36967-af1e-4329-9921-03b851e4018c).Image",
        "Description": "From: al.sharifaqqid7763@dubmail.com\rSubject: Resigning in Style\r\rGreetings. I work as part of the Event Staff here at the building and I just can&apos;t take it anymore. My co-workers are such bastards, always mocking me behind my back. The worst part is the manager Cindy doesn&apos;t even care and won&apos;t do anything about it.\rI sent my resignation letter this morning. Now please take out these specific employees. They always annoyed me the most...",
